<p>Tendrils of flame fire from your hands in a narrow cone. Any foes caught inside will be pulled in towards you and have its movement speed reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 25%, 31%, 34%, 37%</acronym> for 4 turns.</p><p>Each tendril will leave a trail of fire in its path dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">45, 60, 72, 82, 91</acronym> fire damage for 4 turns.</p><p>The damage increases with spellpower.</p>